# Supabase — Blackwater Labs Whitelist

Copy to `.env.local` for local development (never commit real secrets).

```bash
# Public — safe for browser bundle
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# Server-side only — Edge Functions (set in Supabase dashboard, NOT in frontend)
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
```

Edge Functions `check-wallet` and `confirm-wallet` receive `SUPABASE_URL` and
`SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` automatically when deployed via Supabase CLI.
